---
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
import '../../styles/global.css';
import { siteConfig } from '../../config';
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>WISCLAND 2.0 | {siteConfig.name}</title>
  </head>
  <body class="bg-gray-900 text-gray-100 min-h-screen flex flex-col font-sans">
    <Header />

    <main class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-12 flex-grow">
      <a href="/portfolio/" class="text-emerald-400 hover:text-emerald-300 font-medium mb-6 inline-block">
        ← Back to Portfolio
      </a>

      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4 text-white">
        WISCLAND 2.0 High-Resolution Land Cover Update
      </h1>

      <p class="text-lg text-gray-300 mb-8 leading-relaxed">
        Scaled Wisconsin’s statewide land cover classification from 30m (Landsat) to 10m (Sentinel-2) spatial resolution across <strong class="text-emerald-400">1.4 billion pixels (35 million acres)</strong>. Developed within Google Earth Engine (GEE), this project processed over <strong class="text-emerald-400">218 GB</strong> of multi-sensor satellite imagery.
      </p>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-10">
        <div class="bg-gray-800 p-6 rounded-lg border border-gray-700">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3 text-emerald-400">Technical Stack</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-300">
            <li>• <strong>Platform:</strong> Google Earth Engine (GEE JS API)</li>
            <li>• <strong>Satellites:</strong> Sentinel-2 MSI, Sentinel-1 C-Band SAR</li>
            <li>• <strong>Model:</strong> 5-Tier Hierarchical Random Forest</li>
            <li>• <strong>Accuracy:</strong> 88%–93% species-level precision</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-gray-800 p-6 rounded-lg border border-gray-700">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3 text-emerald-400">Core Deliverables</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-300">
            <li>• Statewide 10m Land Cover Raster Map</li>
            <li>• Multi-sensor optical/SAR fusion workflow</li>
            <li>• Confusion matrices across 10,000+ reference points</li>
            <li>• Species-level forest and wetland classification</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="my-8">
        <a 
          href="https://github.com/arikwaldinger" 
          target="_blank" 
          class="inline-block bg-emerald-700 hover:bg-emerald-600 text-white font-semibold px-6 py-3 rounded-lg transition-colors"
        >
          View GEE Repository
        </a>
      </div>
    </main>

    <Footer />
  </body>
</html>
